  "findings": [
    "Nine paired confirmation rounds recompute Sieve 1.610507 speedup/MAD0.028085 on Wasmtime and1.561316/MAD0.003628 on default V8. Both are warmed configured-iteration regions, not launch-to-exit timings.",
