    "Only Sieve changes among ten warmed modules (+384bytes) and ten full-example direct modules (+308bytes). Nine identical modules in each set remain controls. Full Sieve has an owner-backed marking loop but its collector push loop is outside the byte-scan matcher.",
    "Five-round factorial screens are kept separate from nine-round delivery confirmation. Grouping-only Wasmtime was flat/slower while V8 improved; the larger combined benefit is an observed interaction with no asserted hardware explanation.",
    "Full process host, Python/V8 entry probes, LangArena regions and lifecycle modes remain separate cohorts. Native times are not mixed across them. Cache-hit, cold no-cache, precompiled and fresh-Store resident boundaries are explicit.",
